Let $T$ be the text (length $n$), $P$ be the pattern (length $m$), and $\pi$ be the failure function.
```
j = 0 // pointer for pattern P (matched characters)
i = 0 // pointer for text T
while i < n:
    if P[j] == T[i]:
        i += 1
        j += 1
    if j == m:
        // Match found at index (i - j) in T
        // To find subsequent matches:
        j = pi[j - 1] // Shift pattern based on failure function
    elif i < n and P[j] != T[i]:
        // Mismatch after j characters have matched
        if j != 0:
            j = pi[j - 1] // Shift pattern using failure function
        else:
            i += 1 // No prefix to match, move to next char in T
```
